# DatoCMS blocks (next-dato)

Canonical examples: [`faq-group-block.tsx`](../../src/components/patterns/faq-group-block.tsx), [`cta-banner-block.tsx`](../../src/components/sections/cta-banner-block.tsx).

Skill: [`.cursor/skills/add-datocms-block/SKILL.md`](../skills/add-datocms-block/SKILL.md)

## Checklist (new or updated block)

1. Inspect `CtaBannerRecord` / block type in `src/infra/datocms/generated/schema.types.ts` for exact camelCase fields.
2. Add fragment to **`queries.ts`** (`PAGE_STRUCTURED_TEXT_BLOCKS`) and **`page-by-slug.graphql`** (keep in sync).
3. Optional fragment file: `src/infra/datocms/graphql/fragments/{block}.graphql`.
4. Run `npm run codegen`.
5. Add type in `types-page.ts` if needed (often `Extract` or schema import).
6. Implement block component — reuse `SmartLink`, `DatoResponsivePicture`, `Button`.
7. Register `case "{Name}Record":` in `structured-text-block-view.tsx`.
8. Add `resolve*Options()` + tests when block has `advanced_options` or boolean toggles (`hasImage`, etc.).

## Field reading

- CDA camelCase; API keys snake_case — use `readCdaBool(record, "hasImage", "has_image")` etc.
- Links: `LINK_HERO_CTA_FIELDS` + `SmartLink` + `resolveLinkBlock`.
- Images: `IMAGE_BLOCK_RESPONSIVE` + `DatoResponsivePicture`.
- Vídeo: nunca usar `asset.url` (o Dato responde "Serving raw videos is disabled by admin"). Pedir `asset { video { streamingUrl mp4Url(res: high) thumbnailUrl … } }` e resolver com `resolveVideoSources()` — HLS para Safari, MP4 para os restantes, poster do Mux.
- Video captions: model `video_block` precisa de file field `captions` (VTT); até existir, o `<track>` não é emitido.

## RSC note

Blocks rendered via `react-datocms` `renderBlock` that need `await getNonce()` or async children must be **`async function` blocks**, or inject sync JSON-LD via `JsonLdScriptSync`. See `react-rsc.mdc`.

## Anti-patterns

- Updating only `queries.ts` OR only `.graphql`
- `next/dynamic()` for Server Component blocks in ST
- New inline `<img>` instead of `DatoResponsivePicture`
- Custom link parsing instead of `link-block.ts` / `SmartLink`
